# Stoa author-field gate — PRINCIPAL identity allow-list.
# One accepted name or email per line ('#' comments + blanks ignored).
# The pretooluse-author-field-audit.sh gate compares commit author
# identity + staged author-like fields against this list; a value not
# on the list is treated as 'not the PRINCIPAL' and the commit is denied
# with a message naming this file. This is the GATE'S CONFIG, not an
# author field of any repo artifact. Widen it when a legit PRINCIPAL
# identity is missing. An ABSENT or EMPTY list leaves the gate dormant
# (fail-open). Seeded from the target's global git identity at install.
